on/worked-solution "Here, $A$ is $3\\times 1$ matrix and $B$ is a $1\\times 2$ matrix.  \n\nThere is $1$ column in matrix $A$ and $1$ row in matrix $B$, so the product is well defined:\n\n$$\n{A}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 2}={AB}_{3\\times 2}\n$$\n\nComputing the product, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1\\cdot 1 & 1\\cdot (-2) \\\\ 2\\cdot 1 & 2\\cdot (-2) \\\\ (-2)\\cdot 1 & (-2)\\cdot (-2)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-275548/field-1" "q-275548/field-2" "q-275548/field-3" "q-275548/field-4" "q-275548/field-5" "q-275548/field-6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d7d67c6-d54f-5ee1-af59-fd63d6687cfd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-275548"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130136/selection/75ea024d0eb6462b8d3adfb4aaa48dc6c9cecaff4b524ee70b59f677d1820017" :answer/id #uuid "47f2c1e2-7813-52a6-af9e-3f0d8f48a315" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 & 16 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 8 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130136/selection/49cd754718149ff3f2add75ad8c6d5234600a7580ccb30d7487fa232ebe8ff8d" :answer/id #uuid "0b384850-051d-5f19-bd06-c25a7d4f69a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 & 16 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130136/selection/812d0755ef81a8118141a2e96279277205d05f8c2674edd694b6e7182fe52ffd" :answer/id #uuid "036c69e8-cee0-5207-aa3c-688f2ff9474e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 16 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/va